  "statement": {
    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "(R. Mines). It is well known that the topology on the completion of an abelian\ngroup under the p-adic topology is the p-adic topology. R. Warfield has shown that\nthis is also true in the category of nilpotent groups. Find a categorical setting for this\ntheorem which includes the case of nilpotent groups.                       S. V. Rychkov",
